#==============================================================================================
#
#   collections - Growable storage: a list of values, a byte buffer, a pool of kept text
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       `List[T]` grows an array of plain values, `Buffer` a run of bytes that is also an
#       `io.Writer`, and `TextPool` keeps copies of text at addresses that never move. A zero
#       value of each is empty and ready; the first allocation takes the current allocator,
#       every later one uses that same allocator, and `destroy` gives the storage back to it.
#
#==============================================================================================

